  <History Date="11-04-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed name from Wildsun K25 to WildSun-K25.  Revised chase functions." />
  <History Date="11-04-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Standardised across product range.  Added physical P/T limits." />
  <History Date="18-04-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Actually changed the name, rather than just saying so in the history..." />
